            <Paragraphs>
              <Paragraph>
                <TextRuns>
                  <TextRun>
                    <Value>• Drug Mix
• AWP Drug Mix
• Specialty vs. Non-Specialty
• Top Drugs by Plan Cost 
• Top Drugs by Specialty Plan Cost 
• Top Drugs by Claim Volume
• Top 25 Specialty Drugs by Claim Volume
• Top 25 Therapeutic Classes by Plan Cost
• Top Therapeutic Classes by Day Supply</Value>
                    <Style>
                      <FontStyle>Normal</FontStyle>
                      <FontFamily>Calibri</FontFamily>
                      <FontSize>18pt</FontSize>
                      <FontWeight>Bold</FontWeight>
                      <TextDecoration>None</TextDecoration>
